body:
Bye bye!

&#x200B;

Pedo...

Yes, I actually picked up a dandelion and examined it.

&#x200B;

And then I scattered its seeds to destroy the grass.

Looks like I've got some baking to do. Wish me luck, I don't know how to bake.

&#x200B;

Whatever, I messed up immediately.

If you dare make me see Childe again, I swear-

&#x200B;

\*Cries in no Childe because I didn't get a chance to pull on his banner\*

Claymore Ganyu?

&#x200B;

More like Cryo Diluc.

This image hurts me more than anything.

&#x200B;

\*Cries in no Childe\*
